# Force LF line endings for everything text-based, regardless of the
# contributor's OS or editor autocrlf setting. CRLF in a .sh/Makefile/YAML
# file causes exactly the "works locally, fails in CI" class of bug this
# whole pipeline exists to prevent in detection rules — no reason to
# reintroduce it in the tooling around them. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go       text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
*.ts       text eol=lf
*.tsx      text eol=lf
*.js       text eol=lf
*.jsx      text eol=lf
*.json     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.tf       text eol=lf
Makefile   text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
